  "title": "Деревья: обход и сравнение",
  "steps": [
    {
      "type": "theory",
      "title": "Обходы бинарного дерева",
      "content": "## DFS и BFS\n\n- **Preorder / inorder / postorder** — рекурсия или стек.\n- **Level order** — очередь (BFS).\n\nВ JSON дерево — **level-order** массив с `null` (`structure`: `tree`)."
    },
    {
      "type": "svg",
      "title": "Бинарное дерево",
      "content": {
        "caption": "Каждый узел: **left**, **right**",
        "description": "BFS обходит уровень за уровнем.",
        "svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" width=\"100%\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Дерево\"><circle id=\"m06-root\" cx=\"100\" cy=\"25\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#c8e6c9\" stroke=\"#2e7d32\"/><circle id=\"m06-l\" cx=\"60\" cy=\"65\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#e3f2fd\" stroke=\"#1565c0\"/><circle id=\"m06-r\" cx=\"140\" cy=\"65\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#e3f2fd\" stroke=\"#1565c0\"/><line id=\"m06-e1\" x1=\"100\" y1=\"39\" x2=\"60\" y2=\"53\" stroke=\"#78909c\"/><line id=\"m06-e2\" x1=\"100\" y1=\"39\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"53\" stroke=\"#78909c\"/></svg>"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "javascript",
      "title": "Разминка: глубина дерева",
      "content": {
        "description": "**`maxDepth(root)`** — максимальная глубина (пустое дерево → 0).",
        "starterCode": "function maxDepth(root) {\n  return 0;\n}",
        "referenceSolution": "function maxDepth(root) {\n  if (!root) return 0;\n  return 1 + Math.max(maxDepth(root.left), maxDepth(root.right));\n}",
        "setup": "",
        "reset": "",
        "functionName": "maxDepth",
        "timeoutMs": 8000,
        "tests": [
          {
            "args": [
              [
                3,
                9,
                20,
                null,
                null,
                15,
                7
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "args": [
              [
                1,
                null,
                2
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "args": [
              []
            ]
          }
        ],
        "structure": {
          "args": [
            "tree"
          ],
          "result": "raw"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "javascript",
      "title": "Invert Binary Tree",
      "content": {
        "description": "Зеркально отразите дерево. [LeetCode 226. Invert Binary Tree](https://leetcode.com/problems/invert-binary-tree/)",
        "starterCode": "function invertTree(root) {\n  return root;\n}",
        "referenceSolution": "function invertTree(root) {\n  if (!root) return null;\n  const left = invertTree(root.left);\n  const right = invertTree(root.right);\n  root.left = right;\n  root.right = left;\n  return root;\n}",
        "setup": "",
        "reset": "",
        "functionName": "invertTree",
        "timeoutMs": 8000,
        "tests": [
          {
            "args": [
