      "type": "javascript",
      "title": "Maximum Depth of Binary Tree",
      "content": {
        "description": "Максимальная глубина. [LeetCode 104. Maximum Depth of Binary Tree](https://leetcode.com/problems/maximum-depth-of-binary-tree/)",
        "starterCode": "function maxDepthTree(root) {\n  return 0;\n}",
        "referenceSolution": "function maxDepthTree(root) {\n  if (!root) return 0;\n  return 1 + Math.max(maxDepthTree(root.left), maxDepthTree(root.right));\n}",
