    {
      "type": "javascript",
      "title": "Same Tree",
      "content": {
        "description": "Два дерева — одинаковые? [LeetCode 100. Same Tree](https://leetcode.com/problems/same-tree/)",
        "starterCode": "function isSameTree(p, q) {\n  return false;\n}",
        "referenceSolution": "function isSameTree(p, q) {\n  if (!p && !q) return true;\n  if (!p || !q || p.val !== q.val) return false;\n  return isSameTree(p.left, q.left) && isSameTree(p.right, q.right);\n}",
        "setup": "",
        "reset": "",
        "functionName": "isSameTree",
        "timeoutMs": 8000,
        "tests": [
          {
            "args": [
              [
                1,
                2,
                3
